OL,3,GNEWSAGAA footballer involved in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run handed suspended sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Antrim gaelic footballer has been
OL,7,Fgiven a nine-month suspended prison
OL,8,Fsentence after a woman suffered serious
OL,9,Finjuries in a 'hit-and-run' incident.
OL,11,FKavan Keenan was driving a van when it
OL,12,Fstruck Fiona McGill, a mother of two,
OL,13,Fas she walked along the Glenravel Road
OL,14,Fin Martinstown, Co Antrim in October
OL,15,F2024.
OL,17,FThe victim, who was in court for the
OL,18,Fsentencing hearing, had to be treated
OL,19,Fat the major trauma unit at the Royal
OL,20,FVictoria Hospital in Belfast for her
OL,21,Finjuries and her rehabilitation is
OL,22,Fongoing.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
