OL,4,Ahit-and-run handed suspended sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Judge at Antrim Crown Court
OL,7,Fdescribed how she has endured "darks
OL,8,Fdays and nights" since she was knocked
OL,9,Fdown beside the driveway to her home.
